.coverage
htmlcov/

# Terraform
infra/.terraform/
infra/bootstrap/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
infra/terraform.tfvars
infra/bootstrap/terraform.tfvars
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
# infra/.terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored — Terraform
# recommends committing it for reproducible provider versions, and infra/
# is applied repeatedly by CI, so that reproducibility matters there.
# infra/bootstrap/ is applied once, locally, by hand (state stays local
# too, never committed) — re-running it from scratch if ever needed isn't
# sensitive to minor provider version drift, so its lock file isn't worth
# tracking either.
infra/bootstrap/.terraform.lock.hcl
